-Oct),\non top of replit_dev, for deployment to DEV only:\n- \"Report this answer\" files a review item for the module''s trainers\n- \"Manage knowledge\" book icon, shown only to trainers (decided by the assistant)\n5-Oct: \"Report this answer\" is shown only when the central assistant supports it\n(/kb/eligibility answers), so users still on the older live assistant never see a\nbutton that would fail. No server, schema or migration change. tsc 289 (= baseline).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0840690b3a6e626025768adaa41aacdf9ea16cee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/TechnicalMoudle/git/trees/0840690b3a6e626025768adaa41aacdf9ea16cee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/TechnicalMoudle/git/commits/329ee5d4269db0b6bb47dec2a38bf246f3b32e1d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224569240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/safe-lanes","id":224569240,"login":"safe-lanes","node_id":"U_kgDODWKnmA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/safe-lanes/TechnicalMoudle/commit/329ee5d4269db0b6bb47dec2a38bf246f3b32e1d","nod