nicalMoudle/commits/c26d7b4ce2a3d59c812032d7e3ccb8c00f0cae67/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T04:38:50Z","email":"support@sl-sail.com","name":"support"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T04:38:50Z","email":"support@sl-sail.com","name":"support"},"message":"assistant: role from synced master data when the login token carries none (Option B) — genuine SAILERP token has id + userType but NO role (PROVEN on dev 25-Sep); no browser-header fallback\n\nDev widget failed with \"cannot mint: the login token is missing required claim(s): role\" (Nilesh, DevTools).\nThe mint now takes id + userType from the verified token and, when the token has no role claim, resolves the\nrole of that verified user id from the tenant''s synced SAILERP master data (master_users.role) via a new\nmodule repository. A user absent from master data, or with a role outside ASSISTANT_ALLOWED_ROLES, cannot\nmint. The x-user-role header is still never consulted. Audit line logs the role source (token | master_users).\nHarness: JWT without role + user in master data → 200 (role Sail Admin); master data says ''User'' although the\nheader says Sail Admin → 403; user not in master data → 403 (28/28 on the pilot). tsc 294 (0 new).\nRequirement for every environment: master_users populated by the SAILERP master-data import for assistant users.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d3184704feba3ba4aca645049f0847034d23c313","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/TechnicalMoudle/git/trees/d3184704feba3ba4aca645049f0847034d23c313"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/TechnicalMoudle/git/commits/c26d7b4ce2a3d59c812032d7e3ccb8c00f0cae67","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224569240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.gith