,"site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/TechnicalMoudle/commits/d03618dae8445c17f74e3d58d1e29468c53aa33d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:32:36Z","email":"support@sl-sail.com","name":"support"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:32:36Z","email":"support@sl-sail.com","name":"support"},"message":"docs: deployment note §10 — assistant switch and technical-dev registration as separate, prepared (not executed) actions with rollback\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f273a34e4dcab8034ac6090ab906340089ed7a64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/TechnicalMoudle/git/trees/f273a34e4dcab8034ac6090ab906340089ed7a64"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/TechnicalMoudle/git/commits/d03618dae8445c17f74e3d58d1e29468c53aa33d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224569240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/safe-lanes","id":224569240,"login":"safe-lanes","node_id":"U_kgDODWKnmA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/safe-lanes/TechnicalMoudle/commit/d03618dae8445c17f74e3d58d1e29468c53aa33d","node_id":"C_kwDOP13NqNoAKGQwMzYxOGRhZTg0NDVjMTdmNzRlM2Q1OGQxZTI5NDY4YzUzYWEzM2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/safe-lanes/TechnicalMoudle/commit/3c34406a6f75e8f8ba870400e36db7638ddcc4e0","sha":"3c34406a6f75e8f8ba870400e36db7638ddcc4e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/TechnicalMoudle/commits/3c34406a6f75e8f8ba870400e36db7638ddcc4e0"}],"sha":"d03618dae8445c17f74e3d58d1e29468c53aa33d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/TechnicalMoudle/commits/d03618dae8445c17f74e3d58d1e29468c53aa33d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224569240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/safe-lanes","id":224569240,"login":"safe-lanes","node_id":"U_kgDODWKnmA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/TechnicalMoudle/commits/9037a46896fe7f577f91d0ece9ab9e783cd77f7f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:20:54Z","email":"support@sl-sail.com","name":"support"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:20:54Z","email":"support@sl-sail.com","name":"support"},"message":"assistant: one central assistant, many module INSTANCES — trusted per-environment registration (issuer id → own signing key, own secret, exact callback URL); pilot-verified with two environments, NOT merged/pushed/deployed\n\nRequirement (Ghazi/Astra 24-Sep): one assistant URL for every module and environment, each request reaching\nonly its authorised environment. Replaces the single module-keyed URL (ASSISTANT_MODULE_APIS, now retired).\n\nAssistant (central-assistant-py):\n- ASSISTANT_MODULE_INSTANCES = {\"technical-dev\": {module, env, url, secret, signingKey}, \"technical-prod\": {...}}.\n  Half-registered entries are dropped.\n- The token''s `iss` selects the registered signing key (peek_issuer reads it unverified; the signature check that\n  follows uses that key). Unregistered issuer → 401 unknown-issuer; re-labelled / stripped issuer → bad-signature.\n  No callback URL travels in the token — URLs come only from the registration.\n- manifest/execute go ONLY to the issuer''s registered URL with the issuer''s secret; the user token is forwarded\n  only there; httpx follow_redirects=False explicit and any 3xx is reported as a failure; manifest cache keyed by\n  issuer (never module alone); a manifest naming another module is refused; live data only when the widget''s\n  context.module equals the registered module.\n- Tokens without `iss` verify with the shared IDENTITY_SIGNING_KEY and get documentation only. That key MUST differ\n  from every instance key (PROVEN on the pilot: equal keys let an instance-signed, issuer-less token pass as a docs\n  token) — rotated on the pilot.\n- tests/test_env_routing.py (5 unit tests, MockTransport) + scripts/verify_env_routing_pilot.py (tracked pilot\n  harness, 17 checks). Full suite 63/63.\n\nTechnical module: ASSISTANT_INSTANCE_ID required to mint; written as `iss`; the Data API refuses tokens naming\nanother instance even with a valid signature. Harness scripts/verify-assistant-multitenant-auth.ts: 29/29.\n\nPilot proof (assistant pilot-r6 :8044, DEV = shore :5000 technical-dev, PROD = shore :5001 technical-prod with its\nown master registry, keys and secret): dev token → dev data (142) and only the dev instance called; prod token →\nprod instance only (vessel unknown there); dev identity claiming prod, unregistered issuer, removed routing claim,\ninjected callback address, issuer-less instance-signed token → 401; docs-only token answers from manuals with no\ntools; cross-environment tokens/secrets refused by the Data APIs; widget on dev → 142; tenant isolation, verified\nroles, Sail Admin allow-list and shore-only unchanged. Contract: docs/ASSISTANT-API.md §3.5 + §4.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"343648cd8467ae041e5dadf8cf590aeed2f3c4ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/TechnicalMoudle/git/trees/343648cd8467ae041e5dadf8cf590aeed2f3c4ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/TechnicalMoudle/git/commits/9037a46896fe7f577f91d0ece9ab9e783cd77f7f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224569240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/safe-lanes","id":224569240,"login":"safe-lanes","node_id":"U_kgDODWKnmA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saf