vents{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/safe-lanes","id":224569240,"login":"safe-lanes","node_id":"U_kgDODWKnmA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/TechnicalMoudle/commits/305c5f4c499f9426d8a17a442485b09e58ab973c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T05:40:16Z","email":"support@sl-sail.com","name":"support"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T05:40:16Z","email":"support@sl-sail.com","name":"support"},"message":"assistant: pilot handoff — identity trust separated (JWT-verified tenant vs browser-supplied user), userType source stated, genuine-session check recorded, enablement decision documented (docs only; pilot FROZEN, NOT deployed)\n\n- docs/ASSISTANT-API.md 3.2: field-by-field trust table. tenantDomain/tuid = SAILERP JWT `domain` claim, HS256-verified\n  server-side. userId/role/userType/vesselId = browser headers from the decrypted SAILERP profile, NOT server-verified\n  (the module''s own RBAC trust) - access rules applied to a claimed identity, not verified permissions.\n- userType resolved: read from the x-user-type header, never from the JWT; the server reads exactly one JWT claim\n  (`domain`). What the current code requires from SAILERP is stated explicitly.\n- 3.3: the remaining production check with a genuine SAILERP session - decode the payload locally, record claim\n  names / domain / expiry only, never a raw token in chat, reports or Git. Harness gains an optional\n  GENUINE_BEARER check that prints claim names only (test tooling, no functional change; 18/18 without the ship).\n- 3.4: decision required before production live-data enablement - trusted token claims (if the genuine JWT carries\n  them) or a server-side lookup in the tenant''s synced SAILERP user tables (master_users.role/userType, users,\n  admn_role_master, master_user_vessels); no new JWT design assumed.\n- docs/ASSISTANT-PILOT-HANDOFF-2026-09-24.md: commit list, verified-vs-pending matrix, pilot state, enablement steps.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"27c9259ebdde6b92ffc33be9ff0eefcec0978e21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/TechnicalMoudle/git/trees/27c9259ebdde6b92ffc33be9ff0eefcec0978e21"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/TechnicalMoudle/git/commits/305c5f4c499f9426d8a17a442485b09e58ab973c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224569240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/safe-lanes","id":224569240,"login":"safe-lanes","node_id":"U_kgDODWKnmA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/safe-lanes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/user