,"repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jirehcustodio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jirehcustodio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jirehcustodio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jirehcustodio","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jirehcustodio/MyNewPortfolio/commits/ce148bf70367e8f46e21b39500222515cff66c81/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-04T08:36:41Z","email":"jcustodio@gbox.ncf.edu.ph","name":"Jireh Boslon Custodio"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-04T08:36:41Z","email":"jcustodio@gbox.ncf.edu.ph","name":"Jireh Boslon Custodio"},"message":"📊 Implement Comprehensive Portfolio Analytics System\n\n🎯 Analytics Features:\n- Complete Google Analytics 4 integration with custom tracking\n- User interaction tracking for all portfolio components\n- Performance monitoring with Core Web Vitals and custom metrics\n- Scroll depth tracking and engagement measurement\n- Error tracking and debugging capabilities\n\n📈 Event Tracking Implementation:\n- Project interactions (views, demos, source code clicks)\n- Skills section engagement and category navigation\n- Contact form submissions and conversion tracking\n- Blog article reading and search functionality\n- Testimonial interactions and submission tracking\n\n🚀 Advanced Analytics Capabilities:\n- Session duration and user journey mapping\n- Device and browser environment tracking\n- Real-time performance metric collection\n- Scroll behavior and content engagement analysis\n- Social sharing and referral source tracking\n\n🔧 Technical Implementation:\n- Created comprehensive analytics utility library (/src/app/lib/analytics.ts)\n- Google Analytics component with Script optimization\n- Analytics Provider for automatic tracking initialization\n- Privacy-conscious implementation with graceful degradation\n- TypeScript interfaces for type-safe event tracking\n\n💼 Business Intelligence Benefits:\n- Portfolio performance optimization insights\n- Client behavior analysis for better targeting\n- Content performance measurement and improvement\n- Professional analytics demonstration for potential clients\n- Data-driven portfolio enhancement capabilities\n\n🛠️ Setup Documentation:\n- Complete setup guide in ANALYTICS_SETUP.md\n- Environment variable configuration examples\n- Custom event tracking examples and best practices\n- Dashboard configuration and KPI recommendations\n- Privacy compliance and opt-out mechanisms\n\nThis analytics system transforms the portfolio into a data-driven client acquisition tool with comprehensive insights for continuous optimization! 🚀","tree":{"sha":"319cb7d5055f7dfdbf98e121a488a92335e00ac0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jirehcustodio/MyNewPortfolio/git/trees/319cb7d5055f7dfdbf98e121a488a92335e00ac0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jirehcustodio/MyNewPortfolio/git/commits/ce148bf70367e8f46e21b39500222515cff66c81","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/182779395?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jirehcustodio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jirehcustodio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jirehcustodio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jirehcustodio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jirehcustodio","id":182779395,"login":"jirehcustodio","node_id":"U_kgDOCuT-Aw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jirehcustodio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jirehcustodio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jirehcustodio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jirehcustodio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jire