tom comparison function to prevent unnecessary re-renders\n- Created performance monitoring utility with:\n  - measureComponentPerformance() for tracking render times\n  - Automatic warnings for slow renders (>16ms)\n  - Performance statistics and logging\n- Configured bundle size monitoring with size-limit:\n  - Main bundle: 600 KB limit\n  - CSS bundle: 30 KB limit\n- Added comprehensive performance benchmarks:\n  - 10 messages: 78ms (target: <100ms)\n  - 50 messages: 118ms (target: <200ms)\n  - 100 messages: 168ms (target: <500ms)\n  - Re-render: 6ms (target: <50ms) - confirms memoization working\n- Mocked scrollIntoView for jsdom test environment\n\nAll 18 tests passing (6 accessibility + 8 keyboard + 4 performance)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4d471e5af34576658482e9787b1e6037718d753f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecruz165/conversation-ui-assistant/git/trees/4d471e5af34576658482e9787b1e6037718d753f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecruz165/conversation-ui-assistant/git/commits/34c5618557651ed269ae18c5b551c485f370518c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26984958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ecruz165","id":26984958,"login":"ecruz165","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTg0OTU4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github