16Z","email":"ecruz165@yahoo.com","name":"Edwin Cruz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-20T01:44:16Z","email":"ecruz165@yahoo.com","name":"Edwin Cruz"},"message":"feat: implement comprehensive accessibility testing suite (Task 49)\n\nSet up automated accessibility testing with:\n\n1. Testing infrastructure:\n   - Vitest for unit and integration tests\n   - @testing-library/react for component testing\n   - jest-axe for WCAG compliance checks\n   - axe-playwright for E2E accessibility tests\n   - jsdom environment for DOM testing\n\n2. Test utilities (src/test/a11y-test-utils.tsx):\n   - testA11y() function for quick accessibility checks\n   - Preset test options (keyboard, ARIA, color contrast, WCAG 2.1 AA)\n   - Integration with jest-axe matchers\n\n3. Component accessibility tests:\n   - AccessibleButton component tests (4 tests)\n   - InteractiveDiv component tests\n   - SkipLink component tests\n   - All tests verify WCAG compliance\n\n4. Keyboard navigation tests (8 tests):\n   - Tab key focus management\n   - Enter/Space key activation\n   - Focus order verification\n   - Shift+Tab backward navigation\n\n5. Playwright E2E accessibility tests:\n   - Homepage accessibility scanning\n   - Navigation page accessibility\n   - Keyboard navigation validation\n   - Skip link accessibility check\n\n6. Test scripts in package.json:\n   - test: Run all Vitest tests\n   - test:watch: Watch mode for development\n   - test:ui: Interactive UI for test running\n   - test:a11y: Run only accessibility tests\n   - test:e2e: Run Playwright E2E tests\n   - test:e2e:ui: Playwright UI mode\n\nAll 14 tests passing successfully.\n\nGenerated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9a130f0bfa4f9b9ec829e1ae568841bb790b9ff5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecruz165/conversation-ui-assistant/git/trees/9a130f0bfa4f9b9ec829e1ae568841bb790b9ff5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecruz165/convers