pi.github.com/users/ecruz165/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecruz165/conversation-ui-assistant/commits/b40a6623d9af839fdf64c5445d4047d78caede46/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-20T00:53:37Z","email":"ecruz165@yahoo.com","name":"Edwin Cruz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-20T00:53:37Z","email":"ecruz165@yahoo.com","name":"Edwin Cruz"},"message":"chore: configure pre-commit hooks and CI/CD linting (task 39)\n\nSet up automated linting checks with Husky pre-commit hooks and\nGitHub Actions CI/CD integration:\n\n1. Installed and configured Husky and lint-staged\n   - Added husky and lint-staged to devDependencies\n   - Created .husky/pre-commit hook\n   - Configured lint-staged in package.json to run Biome on staged files\n\n2. Created GitHub Actions workflow (.github/workflows/lint.yml)\n   - Runs on push and PR to main/develop branches\n   - Executes linting, type checking, and format checking\n   - Uses Node.js 20 with npm caching for faster builds\n\n3. Configured VSCode integration\n   - Added .vscode/settings.json with Biome as default formatter\n   - Enabled format on save\n   - Configured code actions on save (organize imports, quick fixes)\n   - Added .vscode/extensions.json with Biome extension recommendation\n\nFiles added/modified:\n- package.json (added lint-staged config and husky prepare script)\n- .husky/pre-commit (runs lint-staged)\n- .github/workflows/lint.yml (CI/CD linting workflow)\n- .vscode/settings.json (IDE configuration)\n- .vscode/extensions.json (recommended extensions)\n\nAll builds successful, smoke tests passed.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"s