estions are unique strings, safe to use as keys\n\n2. MessageList.tsx:\n   - Changed key from idx to `${message.id}-suggestion-${idx}-${suggestion}`\n   - Combines message ID with suggestion for uniqueness\n\n3. ScoreBreakdownBars.tsx:\n   - Changed key from idx to scoreData.label\n   - Labels are unique within the scores array\n\nBenefits:\n- Stable keys prevent unnecessary re-renders\n- Improved React performance\n- Better component state preservation\n- Eliminates array index key lint warnings\n\nTesting:\n- Build: ✅ Successful (5.62s)\n- Array index key warnings: ✅ Fixed (0 remaining)\n- Playwright smoke test: ✅ All tests PASSED\n- Zero console/page errors\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6191130ab702cab141cf9657a50fa10a80a259cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecruz165/conversation-ui-assistant/git/trees/6191130ab702cab141cf9657a50fa10a80a259cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecruz165/conversation-ui-assistant/git/commits/9b51b3736dd840e5b83af03fc117dc04a3cb605c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26984958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ecruz165","id":26984958,"login":"ecruz165","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTg0OTU4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_ur