z"},"message":"feat: enhance LinkForm fields and improve embedding process\n\n- Added `startingPath` field to `LinkForm` for journey pages requiring user input.\n- Improved field labeling for better clarity (e.g., `Title`, `Page Type`, `Description`).\n- Enhanced UI for parameter slots and journey-specific input fields.\n- Updated `LinkDetailDialog` with editable embeddings, generation progress states, and tooltip support.\n- Refactored `useEnhancedEmbeddingTest` to utilize mock data from a centralized module.\n- Introduced editable embeddings in `LinkDetailDialog` with initialization and save/cancel functionality.\n- Minor visual updates and mock data adjustments for embedding tests.","tree":{"sha":"81ea722ebd5f7290bb58918d2ace5f8bc769df19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecruz165/conversation-ui-assistant/git/trees/81ea722ebd5f7290bb58918d2ace5f8bc769df19"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecruz165/conversation-ui-assistant/git/commits/ef6a0e23546f5b5a8420d7a13523bd88a6d3783e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26984958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ecruz165","id":26984958,"login":"ecruz165","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTg0OTU4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ecruz165/conversation-ui-assistant/commit/ef6a0e23546f5b5a8420d7a13523bd88a6d3783e","node_id":"C_kwDOP2SoVtoAKGVmNmEwZTIzNTQ2ZjViNWE4NDIwZDdhMTM1MjNiZDg4YTZkMzc4M2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ecruz165/conversation-ui-assistant/commit/4399802e7129d00966454f987eb711d11b66cf28","sha":"4399802e7129d00966454f987eb711d11b66cf28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecruz165/conversation-ui-assistant/commits/4399802e7129d00966454f987eb711d11b66cf28"}],"sha":"ef6a0e23546f5b5a8420d7a13523bd88a6d3783e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecruz165/conversation-ui-assistant/commits/ef6a0e23546f5b5a8420d7a13523bd88a6d3783e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26984958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ecruz165","id":26984958,"login":"ecruz165","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTg0OTU4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecruz165/conversation-ui-assistant/commits/4399802e7129d00966454f987eb711d11b66cf28/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-17T16:11:43Z","email":"ecruz165@yahoo.com","name":"Edwin Cruz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-17T16:11:43Z","email":"ecruz165@yahoo.com","name":"Edwin Cruz"},"message":"feat: optimize caching, improve skeleton loader, and enhance virtual scrolling\n\n- **Caching Optimization**: Refined query client default options with optimized caching (e.g., `staleTime`, `gcTime`, and `refetch` settings) for better performance and offline support.\n- **Page Skeleton**: Added a reusable `PageSkeleton` component using MUI''s skeleton loader for consistent loading experience.\n- **Virtual Scrolling**: Implemented virtual scrolling for analysis history using `@tanstack/react-virtual` for better performance on large datasets.\n- **Lazy Loading**: Enabled code splitting and lazy loading for heavy components like `ScreenshotAnalysis` with suspense fallback and error boundaries.\n- **UI/UX Enhancements**: Improved debounce-based search functionality, prefetched navigation links, and updated various components with memoization for optimized re-renders.\n- **Dependencies Update**: Replaced `framer-motion` with `motion/react`, added `react-window` and `react-virtualized-auto-sizer` for virtualization.\n- **Miscellaneous**: Minor hook additions, dependency cleanups, and usability improvements across pages.","tree":{"sha":"45329ec8f01e711342b09545f9172083faba3ec2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecruz165/conversation-ui-assistant/git/trees/45329ec8f01e711342b09545f9172083faba3ec2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecruz165/conversation-ui-assistant/git/commits/4399802e7129d00966454f987eb711d11b66cf28","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26984958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ecruz165","id":269