s","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecruz165/conversation-ui-assistant/commits/891e4d46f639d65404ce1fcc279227905566b97f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-26T12:00:24Z","email":"ecruz165@yahoo.com","name":"Edwin Cruz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-26T12:00:24Z","email":"ecruz165@yahoo.com","name":"Edwin Cruz"},"message":"fix: resolve test compilation errors and startup issues\n\nTest Configuration Fixes:\n- Removed PgVector auto-configuration exclusion from test class\n- Updated test properties to disable JDBC dependencies\n- Disabled Flyway for tests to avoid database requirements\n- Added proper Spring AI test configuration\n- Removed unused imports and annotations\n\nChanges:\n- NavigationServiceApplicationTests: Removed invalid PgVector exclusion\n- application-test.properties: Disabled external dependencies for tests\n- Clean test configuration for reactive-only setup\n\nThe application should now start without JDBC-related errors\nand tests should compile and run successfully.","tree":{"sha":"0147224a633cb3ef6a65458ccaae76761ebdb7d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecruz165/conversation-ui-assistant/git/trees/0147224a633cb3ef6a65458ccaae76761ebdb7d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecruz165/conversation-ui-assistant/git/commits/891e4d46f639d65404ce1fcc279227905566b97f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26984958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/followers","following_url":