_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecruz165/conversation-ui-assistant/commits/5ea90db410c1a03dee2c27d8029c74f8de57fe6d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-26T11:55:54Z","email":"ecruz165@yahoo.com","name":"Edwin Cruz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-26T11:55:54Z","email":"ecruz165@yahoo.com","name":"Edwin Cruz"},"message":"feat: implement reactive in-memory storage with async persistence\n\nArchitecture Changes:\n- Created MessagePersistenceService for reactive message storage\n- Created ReactiveVectorStoreService for in-memory vector operations\n- Removed PgVector dependency to avoid JDBC conflicts\n- Kept OpenAI integration for AI chat functionality\n- Added async persistence queues for background processing\n\nKey Features:\n- In-memory message storage with ConcurrentLinkedQueue\n- In-memory vector store with cosine similarity search\n- Background persistence processors (5s for messages, 10s for vectors)\n- Non-blocking operations compatible with Netty\n- Reactive streams for real-time message/vector updates\n- Configurable persistence backends (database, file, external API)\n\nBenefits:\n- Fast in-memory access for real-time chat\n- Async persistence prevents blocking Netty threads\n- Scalable architecture for high-throughput messaging\n- Easy to swap persistence backends\n- Full reactive compatibility\n\nUsage:\n- Messages stored in memory, persisted asynchronously\n- Vector embeddings cached in memory for fast similarity search\n- Background processes handle persistence without blocking\n- OpenAI integration available for AI responses","tree":{"sha":"bfa4f134d87607cc320ae895747a5cee32f2abcd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecruz165/conversation-ui-assistant/git/trees/bfa4f134d87607cc320ae895747a5cee32f2abcd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecruz165/conversation-ui-assistant/git/commits/5ea90db410c1a03dee2c27d8029c74f8de57fe6d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26984958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ecruz165","id":26984958,"login":"ecruz165","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTg0OTU4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecruz165","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ecruz165/conversation-ui-assistant/commit/5ea90db410c1a03dee2c27d8029c74f8de57fe6d","node_id":"C_kwDOP2SoVtoAKDVlYTkwZGI0MTBjMWEwM2RlZTJjMjdkODAyOWM3NGY4ZGU1N2ZlNmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ecruz165/conversation-ui-assistant/commit/dd646c239f61a40f4d047397132c83ce65b04015","sha":"dd646c239f61a40f4d047397132c83ce65b04015","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecruz165/conversation-ui-assistant/commits/dd646c239f61a40f4d047397132c83ce65b04015"}],"sha":"5ea90db410c1a03dee2c27d8029c74f8de57fe6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecruz165/conversation-ui-assistant/commits/5ea90db410c1a03dee2c27d8029c74f8de57fe6d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.github