9Z","email":"ecruz165@yahoo.com","name":"Edwin Cruz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-25T15:44:29Z","email":"ecruz165@yahoo.com","name":"Edwin Cruz"},"message":"feat: complete project setup and infrastructure\n\nMajor additions and improvements:\n- Added complete backend services (management-service, navigation-service)\n- Added frontend applications (management-ui, demo-app, chat-widget-mfe)\n- Added comprehensive testing infrastructure with Playwright\n- Added Docker Compose setup for development and production\n- Added pnpm workspace configuration for monorepo management\n- Added Makefile-based build system across all modules\n- Added database migrations for both services\n- Added complete documentation and README updates\n\nBackend Services:\n- management-service: Spring Boot service for admin operations\n- navigation-service: Spring WebFlux service for real-time chat\n\nFrontend Applications:\n- management-ui: TanStack Start-based admin interface\n- demo-app: React demo application with Module Federation\n- chat-widget-mfe: React micro-frontend for chat widget\n\nInfrastructure:\n- Docker Compose configurations for all environments\n- PostgreSQL with pgvector extension setup\n- Nginx reverse proxy configuration\n- Complete testing suite with E2E, load, and security tests\n\nDevelopment Experience:\n- Consistent make commands across all modules\n- pnpm workspace for unified dependency management\n- Hot reload and development servers for all applications\n- Comprehensive documentation and setup guides","tree":{"sha":"16c7b054dc9a433685d0e32d89d02da5d6270e18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecruz165/conversation-ui-assistant/git/trees/16c7b054dc9a433685d0e32d89d02da5d6270e18"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecruz165/conversation-ui-assistant/git/commits/f3fa3242b81b03b87287145f01c823f8c7464005","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars