适用场景、注意事项、选择原则\n\n📊 样式方案对比页面完成：\n- 🔍 概览对比 - 4种方案的核心指标、优缺点对比\n- 📈 详细分析 - 性能指标、功能对比表、学习曲线分析\n- 🎯 选择建议 - 项目类型推荐、团队规模建议、2024年推荐排序\n- 📋 功能矩阵 - 作用域隔离、动态样式、主题支持等功能对比\n\n⚡ 性能测试页面完成：\n- 🏃‍♂️ 交互式基准测试 - 模拟真实测试环境、动态性能评分\n- 📊 详细性能指标 - 渲染时间、包体积、内存使用、重渲染次数\n- 🎯 性能等级评估 - A/B/C/D 等级评分系统、最佳/最差性能标识\n- 💡 优化建议 - 针对每种方案的具体优化策略和最佳实践\n- 🔧 测试环境说明 - 测试设备、测试场景、测试指标详细说明\n\n🌟 技术亮点：\n- ✅ 完整的交互式演示 - 实时代码示例、复制功能、动态效果\n- ✅ 现代化的设计系统 - 统一的卡片、按钮、配色、动画\n- ✅ 响应式适配 - 移动端友好的布局和交互\n- ✅ TypeScript 类型安全 - 完整的类型定义和接口设计\n- ✅ 性能优化 - 懒加载、动画优化、内存管理\n- ✅ 用户体验 - 加载状态、错误处理、无障碍访问\n- ✅ 教学价值 - 从基础到高级的完整学习路径\n\n📈 项目价值：\n- 🎓 完整的样式方案学习体系\n- 💼 可直接应用于实际项目的代码\n- 🔧 技术选型的决策支持工具\n- 📚 样式工程化的最佳实践集合\n\n现在样式解决方案阶段 100% 完成！","tree":{"sha":"5abf3e01e69fe03d87a4f96b5c499a3e18310a9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shunrong/react-learning/git/trees/5abf3e01e69fe03d87a4f96b5c499a3e18310a9c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shunrong/react-learning/git/commits/715686b478d20c7d05280195877cffbe782dc707","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22439015?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shunrong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shunrong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shunrong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shunrong/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shunrong","id":22439015,"login":"shunrong","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDM5MDE1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shunrong/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shunrong/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shunrong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shunrong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shunrong/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shunrong","user_view_type":"public