:"1019486850@qq.com","name":"shunrong"},"message":"feat: 第五阶段 React Router 演进系统\n\n🎯 完整的路由学习系统:\n- 📚 理论文档 - React Router 完整演进历史 (v3→v6)\n- 🏗️ 项目架构 - 现代化的 Vite + React + TypeScript\n- 🎨 精美界面 - Tailwind CSS + Framer Motion 动画\n- 🧭 智能导航 - 侧边栏 + 顶部导航 + 路径显示\n\n📖 理论文档深度:\n- 🕰️ 前端路由发展史 - Hash vs History 路由\n- 🔄 React Router 演进 - 从 v3 静态路由到 v6 现代化\n- 💡 设计理念变迁 - 静态配置 → 组件化 → Hooks\n- 🎯 版本对比分析 - 特性、迁移策略、最佳实践\n\n🎮 交互式项目特性:\n- 📱 响应式设计 - 移动端友好\n- ⚡ 流畅动画 - 页面切换和交互效果\n- 🔗 路径显示 - 实时显示当前路由状态\n- 📊 学习进度 - 可视化学习进度跟踪\n\n🛠️ 技术栈优势:\n- React Router v6 - 最新路由技术\n- Framer Motion - 专业动画库\n- Lucide React - 现代图标系统\n- TypeScript - 完整类型安全\n\n🎉 运行状态:\n- ✅ 本地服务器: http://localhost:3006\n- ✅ 所有依赖安装完成\n- ✅ 构建配置优化\n- ✅ 开发环境就绪\n\n为深入学习 React Router 奠定了坚实基础！","tree":{"sha":"81523e8237df1cf04bd591b5457494d064cc5e13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shunrong/react-learning/git/trees/81523e8237df1cf04bd591b5457494d064cc5e13"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shunrong/react-learning/git/commits/884566102ffef34da74e7d0605d7f1bf188b7823","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22439015?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shunrong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shunrong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shunrong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shunrong/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shunrong","id":22439015,"login":"shunrong","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDM5MDE1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shunrong/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shunrong/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shunrong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shunrong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shunrong/subscriptions","type":"User","url"