adeep3221/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pradeep3221/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pradeep3221/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pradeep3221/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pradeep3221/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pradeep3221","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pradeep3221/ng-AngularMFE/commits/c5b225ad71114ec38e57141438c3f6b007b7c1c6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-26T07:52:15Z","email":"pradeep3221@gmail.com","name":"Pradeep Kumar Katakam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-26T07:52:15Z","email":"pradeep3221@gmail.com","name":"Pradeep Kumar Katakam"},"message":"🔐 Authentication Features Implemented:\nCross-MFE Communication:\n✅ Window.postMessage API for seamless authentication state synchronization\n✅ Real-time authentication events (LOGIN_SUCCESS, LOGOUT, REDIRECT)\n✅ Iframe communication between Shell and Authentication MFE\nLogin Functionality:\n✅ Enhanced login component with demo credentials display\n✅ Automatic redirect after successful authentication\n✅ Return URL handling for seamless user experience\n✅ Parent window notification for cross-MFE coordination\nUser Details Display:\n✅ Comprehensive user profile with personal information\n✅ Account details including roles and permissions\n✅ Professional user interface with Bootstrap styling\n✅ Responsive design for all screen sizes\nLogout Functionality:\n✅ Confirmation dialog for logout action\n✅ Cross-MFE logout notification to all applications\n✅ Complete session cleanup and redirect to home page\n✅ Secure token management with proper cleanup\n\n🎨 User Experience Features:\nProfessional UI/UX:\n✅ Bootstrap 5 responsive design\n✅ Font Awesome & Material Icons integration\n✅ Consistent styling across all MFEs\n✅ Accessible components with proper ARIA labels\nAuthentication Flow:\n✅ Seamless login experience with automatic redirects\n✅ Demo credentials for easy testing\n✅ Session management with secure token handling\n✅ Cross-MFE state synchronization\nSecurity Features:\n✅ MSAL integration ready for Azure AD B2C\n✅ PKCE support for enhanced security\n✅ HTTP interceptors for automatic token attachment\n✅ Route guards for access control\n🚀 Ready for Testing:\nThe complete microfrontend architecture is now running with:\n\nShell Application (http://localhost:4200) - Main orchestrator with authentication integration\nMFE1 Dashboard (http://localhost:4201) - Business analytics with auth protection\nMFE2 User Management (http://localhost:4202) - User administration with role-based access\nMFE3 Authentication (http://localhost:4203) - Dedicated authentication portal\n🎯 Next Steps for Production:\nConfigure Azure AD B2C - Replace demo service with real Azure AD B2C settings\nTest SSO Flow - Verify authentication state across all MFEs\nDeploy to Production - All applications are containerized and ready for deployment\nMonitor Performance - Authentication flow is optimized for production use\nThe Authentication MFE integration with Shell and other MFEs, including login, user details, and logout functionality has been successfully implemented! 🎉","tree":{"sha":"991b30f99fdda2f86666728d65566d2ef32fb5a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pradeep3221/ng-AngularMFE/git/trees/991b30f99fdda2f86666728d65566d2ef32fb5a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pradeep3221/ng-AngularMFE/git/commits/c5b225ad71114ec38e57141438c3f6b007b7c1c6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62168732?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pradeep3221/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pradeep3221/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pradeep3221/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https