nt to /graphql/immutable for public access\n\nCo-authored-by: doitsu2014 <12025741+doitsu2014@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix GraphQL queries to match backend API schema\n\nCo-authored-by: doitsu2014 <12025741+doitsu2014@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Phase 1-3: Fix language switcher, add translations, implement dynamic pages\n\nCo-authored-by: doitsu2014 <12025741+doitsu2014@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Phase 4: Add SSR with dynamic SEO meta tags for all routes\n\nCo-authored-by: doitsu2014 <12025741+doitsu2014@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix HomePage, CategoriesPage, CategoryDetailPage, and PostDetailPage issues\n\nCo-authored-by: doitsu2014 <12025741+doitsu2014@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Add highlight.js for code syntax highlighting in post detail page\n\nCo-authored-by: doitsu2014 <12025741+doitsu2014@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Update pnpm-lock.yaml to add and update dependencies for Apollo Client, GraphQL, Highlight.js, i18next, and React-i18next\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: copilot-swe-agent[bot] <198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: doitsu2014 <12025741+doitsu2014@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Duc Tran Huu <ductranhuu@dragoncapital.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpYmq5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAApv4QABSpoRHKafxaL3XpXHV4+MYT\nzTteubXAjEbGhmLCL7mjuNORJSsJlW1nmo5SQcIqB0G4Y+AdD70V0sO+sE2HLt+8\nRcjT6NShME4CDS7ArkE4ZIeTX9d/IJRwe+EAxd9V4SGTVc6IxOb+wdLqpQriwriI\nu5W+6E5eAzDO4Hadoj4i6OENc9hD2z8CeEgCORU+nEEOHe0YuRsJ6fjukiv0LLOP\nuP6eE0ZMwWBAXL3aC5GXMZgGJ2XAYvXEJ3m/UV+ikdaVKpIk64pwVlSEK6OSOZyJ\nOHWo1K1jyroTC1HAivhrj4HX5dc3R7nLNcTR26yeXhNF/aHn1yvTZG9fx8Ig8NpY\n9Gf7rLpCFFhl8FjLRH/LdP+rBk9nagOnODmxNlqa1dnS6S0LnMqNJ+P1Z1qgfI5U\nAMocz5hydIBv7h6bzBApuh8lMYG+NAECgnmrwVJ4b/kNL8LWVIlrKrWNNHfZDU5R\nfDqQprAFFgpp2qJG26T27iyiao0hxsYp2DtoHFAfmKdx/Qy399aEcBnC9/AxVVyd\nNL/HIy8MN1EXoIiUN8O94iOs3BMMfA0J47uT8Lb7946ytg3ejzn4wB9IDie4BJcl\n5VQ9JFamHNy5gD8jCjqJusRgW6+3xfcH2KdOtUoTsxOuLLB4XIwPzxZmhZ