"html_url":"https://github.com/doitsu2014","id":12025741,"login":"doitsu2014","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMDI1NzQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/doitsu2014/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/doitsu2014/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/doitsu2014/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/doitsu2014/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/doitsu2014/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/doitsu2014","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/doitsu2014/my-blogs-rsbuild/commits/75213cfa1fdee7a930e279b9cf5a5832dcff4c71/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-18T15:04:52Z","email":"thd1152015@gmail.com","name":"Duc Tran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-18T15:04:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Dev (#1)\n\n* feat: enhance micro-frontend architecture with updated README, module federation configuration, and dependency upgrades\n\n* fix: ensure correct requiredVersion for shared dependencies and update CSS styles for homepage module\n\n* docs: update README to reflect Shell application architecture, purpose, and configuration details\n\n* refactor: update module names and routing in shell application\n\n- Changed the remote module name from ''homepage'' to ''client_side'' in rsbuild.config.ts.\n- Updated the default route to redirect to ''/client_side'' instead of ''/homepage'' in App.tsx.\n- Modified ModuleLoader to lazy load ''client_side/App'' instead of ''homepage/App''.\n- Adjusted the type declaration for the client-side module in modules.d.ts.\n\n* feat: add admin_side micro-frontend with initial setup and integration\n\n- Created rsbuild configuration for admin_side with React and Module Federation plugins.\n- Added App component with basic styling and structure.\n- Defined TypeScript environment types for SVG imports.\n- Set up entry point for admin_side application.\n- Configured TypeScript settings for admin_side.\n- Updated shell environment to include admin_side remote.\n- Created type definitions for admin_side module in shell.\n- Integrated admin_side into shell''s ModuleLoader for dynamic loading.\n\n* feat: add route for admin_side module in App component\n\n* feat: refactor shell application for module federation and SSR support\n\n- Updated rsbuild.config.ts to define separate environments for admin and client-side applications, including SSR configurations.\n- Implemented a new Express server (server.ts) to handle SSR for client-side routes.\n- Created App.admin.tsx and App.client.tsx for admin and client-side routing respectively.\n- Removed the old App.tsx and replaced it with specific module loaders for admin and client applications.\n- Added ModuleLoader.admin.tsx and ModuleLoader.client.tsx for lazy loading of respective modules.\n- Introduced index files for admin and client entry points (index.admin.client.tsx, index.client.client.tsx) to support SSR and client-side rendering.\n- Implemented server-side rendering logic in index.client.server.tsx.\n- Updated module declarations in modules.d.ts to include admin-side module.","tree":{"sha":"5d6838adea064b3e2575f2e852c904035196d4ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/doitsu2014/my-blogs-rsbuild/git/trees/5d6838adea064b3e2575f2e852c904035196d4ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/doitsu2014/my-blogs-rsbuild/git/commits/75213cfa1fdee7a930e279b9cf5a5832dcff4c71","verification":{"payload":"tree 5d6838adea064b3e2575f2e852c904035196d4ce\nparent ee4a52e888c80bd8deff3a82a250e0484c13b5a4\nauthor Duc Tran <thd1152015@gmail.com> 1766070292 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1766070292 +0700\n\nDev (#1)\n\n* feat: enhance micro-frontend architecture with updated README, module federation configuration, and dependency upgrades\n\n* fix: ensure correct requiredVersion for shared dependencies and update CSS styles for homepage module\n\n* docs: update README to reflect Shell application architecture, purpose, and configuration details\n\n* refactor: update module names and routing in shell application\n\n- Changed the remote module name from ''homepage'' to ''client_side'' in rsbuild.config.ts.\n- Updated the default route to redirect to ''/client_side'' instead of ''/homepage'' in App.tsx.\n- Modified ModuleLoader to lazy load ''client_side/App'' instead of ''homepage/App''.\n- Adjusted the type declaration for the client-side module in modules.d.ts.\n\n* feat: add admin_side micro-frontend with initial setup and integration\n\n- Created rsbuild configuration for admin_side with React and Module Federation plugins.\n- Added App component with basic styling and structure.\n- Defined TypeScript environment types for SVG imports.\n- Set up entry point for admin_side application.\n- Configured TypeScript settings for admin_side.\n- Updated shell environment to include admin_side remote.\n- Created type definitions for admin_side module in shell.\n- Integrated admin_side into shell''s ModuleLoader for dynamic loading.\n\n* feat: add route for admin_side module in App component\n\n* feat: refactor shell application for module federation and SSR support\n\n- Updated rsbuild.config.ts to define separate environments for admin and client-side applications, including SSR configurations.\n- Implemented a new Express server (server.ts) to handle SSR for client-side routes.\n- Created App.admin.tsx and App.client.tsx for admin and client-side routing respectively.\n- Removed the old App.tsx and replaced it with specific module loaders for admin and client applications.\n- Added ModuleLoader.admin.tsx and ModuleLoader.client.tsx for lazy loading of respective modules.\n- Introduced index files for admin and client entry points (index.admin.client.tsx, index.client.client.tsx) to support SSR and client-side rendering.\n- Implemented server-side rendering logic in index.client.server.tsx.\n- Updated module declarations in modules.d.ts to include admin-side module.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpRBgUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAE5cQAA02Debh26X74cMksP42RU/n\ni/W+yuIihOGTLGtNb7AKNjAIhOTAgAZBjEy+AdRlw4TlTY66QWqf12VAWROxex1S\n7O7pxU5Kj4xvgiTpHoVn1l3Q9yQiAkJzHPIg9VM8rDLhe+oyTHUfQ8cL7ustHgw8\nRrnluEDmrX8Z7XwvDVpuhS8fzV+yrxFMUjlRy2QUU8EdvY0tPu3RiHUzJw5RGarz\nTo1mpvpLwjtpyR2yQsqH4yCIPtzlpWsrR3hGEhtZw6+XokxxAS/c/cjEsTYijE3R\nQBlnabIrgHrQ1c0mIXaV+NKtYk2OqPOCg5QxUxBzcrjAUccD7xD5Q0O5/9bwz0wH\nkfZ5FaVQPANDo6dvojD8vWO+9HdN/QtNNKFs2kYry8Agrvb1X/X2dLPHWrbflvRy\n4tNynvEK9QsmSpiUJTsU/qSIXj+rdR8hqVFLblLe9sHCQk5UDfYgBUxETKhyOTQI\njgbh7lpIc5luo2aws40swqXbq8P0TLqnKdjCVWhpmdOilWPvG4ovXLuPzAaga7Kb\n5fMSMF0M0Zrtk2JOim9GiFzJO2rHkT/KZ4F+fXX5Uw3FGxxx68HcbdqTDa0o5Ad0\nzkOsJ31FKbWlOwK7nxi2iqfTh0dAmIJIwF8MTWQEXUZ1cf2B97KVbaXRAjbZoRGP\nN3TPMyky9fW7ywmlYqlX\n=DyRI\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-12-18T15:04:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/doitsu2014/my-blogs-rsbuild/commit/75213cfa1fdee7a930e279b9cf5