@gmail.com","name":"Raaj Patel"},"message":"feat: initialize modular enterprise app with workspaces and core packages\n\n- Added package.json for the root workspace with scripts for build, dev, test, lint, and deploy.\n- Created state-core package with Zustand for state management, including store creation and TypeScript configuration.\n- Developed UI Kit package with shared components (Button, Card) and Storybook integration for documentation.\n- Implemented utility functions for formatting currency, dates, and text truncation in the utils package.\n- Configured Turbo for build pipeline management across packages.","tree":{"sha":"a75219f711b4b3446424437f330136effd59d5c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/raj19o6/modular_app/git/trees/a75219f711b4b3446424437f330136effd59d5c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/raj19o6/modular_app/git/commits/5b0f982271cff078beb9c658c29a3ba389a8476c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/214227258?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raajhumbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raajhumbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raajhumbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raajhumbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/raajhumbingo","id":214227258,"login":"raajhumbingo","node_id":"U_kgDODMTZOg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raajhumbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raajhumbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raajhumbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raajhumbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raajhumbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raajhumbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_