n\n* feat(devtools): include `element` in event details and add diff styling to events panel\n\n* refactor(devtools): use spread operator for immutability in log entries assignment\n\n* feat(devtools): introduce new lifecycle visualization and additional panels\n\n- Added `lifecycle-stepper` to visualize app lifecycle with distinct states and error handling.\n- Introduced `timeline` and `dom-tree` panels for detailed app state and DOM element inspection.\n- Updated tab navigation to accommodate new panels and restructured tab logic.\n- Improved styling for events, props editor, and overlays for better readability.\n\n* refactor(devtools): decouple CSS tokens into separate file and simplify imports\n\n- Moved `tokens.css` into a standalone file for clearer styling management.\n- Simplified the `tokens.css.ts` module by using `unsafeCSS` with inlined tokens.\n- Updated dependencies in `package-lock.json`, including tooling-related upgrades.\n- Removed unused `tsup.config.ts` as part of cleanup efforts.\n\n* refactor(devtools): replace outline styling with overlay for element highlighting\n\n* feat(devtools): add unmounted state handling and ghost app tracking\n\n- Introduced `unmounted` state for lifecycle handling across components.\n- Added ghost app tracking to preserve unmounted app details in the DevTools panel.\n- Updated badge styling and lifecycle visualization to reflect unmounted state.\n- Enhanced log and app state management for accurate tracking of unmounted apps.\n\n* refactor(devtools): extend fallback font stacks for improved cross-browser consistency\n\n* feat(devtools): improve instance state handling and prop management\n\n- Added `_props` state to streamline property management in `instance-card`.\n- Enhanced lifecycle handling with `#refreshProps` and optimized `#copyId` behavior.\n- Introduced event listeners for prop changes (`prop-edit`, `prop-remove`, `prop-add`).\n- Fixed `unmountedAt` fallback in `devtools-panel` for consistent ghost app tracking.\n- Improved error handling for remount lifecycle and storage parsing logic.\n\n* chore(deps): remove `peer` field from `package-lock.json` entries\n\n* Potential fix for pull request finding\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(devtools): unsubscribe event bus listeners on disconnect\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/F2WC/wcf-renderer/sessions/4c5d3f0f-23d7-4cb3-afa1-2534e0d87ac1\n\nCo-authored-by: AckermannJan <11974948+AckermannJan@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* refactor(devtools): simplify event listener type declaration\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/F2WC/wcf-renderer/sessions/4c5d3f0f-23d7-4cb3-afa1-2534e0d87ac1\n\nCo-authored-by: AckermannJan <11974948+AckermannJan@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* refactor(devtools): rename MFE event name alias\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/F2WC/wcf-renderer/sessions/4c5d3f0f-23d7-4cb3-afa1-2534e0d87ac1\n\nCo-authored-by: AckermannJan <11974948+AckermannJan@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* style(devtools): normalize MFE event type alias casing\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/F2WC/wcf-renderer/sessions/4c5d3f0f-23d7-4cb3-afa1-2534e0d87ac1\n\nCo-authored-by: AckermannJan <11974948+AckermannJan@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Potential fix for pull request finding\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(devtools,sdk): address remaining reviewer findings\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/F2WC/wcf-renderer/sessions/b7ff791f-5d3d-41cc-bf0b-71525bdf6ee8\n\nCo-authored-by: AckermannJan <11974948+AckermannJan@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(sdk): compare object keysets in deep prop equality\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/F2WC/wcf-renderer/sessions/b7ff791f-5d3d-41cc-bf0b-71525bdf6ee8\n\nCo-authored-by: AckermannJan <11974948+AckermannJan@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* refactor: tighten record guard and object key comparison\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/F2WC/wc