projects caused by stripped `@vite-ignore` annotations during minification.\n- Consumers are responsible for minifying their own bundles.\n\n* refactor(sdk+shell): improve error logging and simplify code style\n\n- Wrapped `res.status` in `String` to ensure consistent type handling in error messages.\n- Replaced multiline statements and improved readability for `addedStyles` and `entryAbsPath` logic.\n- Standardized quotes in `Taskfile.yml` descriptions for consistency.\n- Updated `package-lock.json` to include `peer: true` for affected dependencies.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Jan Ackermann <jan.ackermann@real-digital.de>","tree":{"sha":"0f284b6041dc838a816279cb211668feeebf4c3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/F2WC/wcf-renderer/git/trees/0f284b6041dc838a816279cb211668feeebf4c3c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/F2WC/wcf-renderer/git/commits/3ca41a666fb5ceffeef147000bb6c4f4de5f88d7","verification":{"payload":"tree 0f284b6041dc838a816279cb211668feeebf4c3c\nparent 5c7227bc2cb2dff482d30d7561e07a3a444f67f6\nauthor Jan Ackermann <eric-ackermann@hotmail.de> 1778854329 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778854329 +0200\n\nImprove local devx and react setup (#19)\n\n* refactor(root): remove Nx configuration and streamline project setup\n\n- Replaced Nx configuration with a Docker and Caddy-based setup for simplified service orchestration.\n- Removed `project.json` files for all packages and updated `package.json` scripts accordingly.\n- Introduced a `Taskfile.yml` for simplified dev workflows.\n- Added support for HMR via a custom Vite plugin (`web-component-framework-renderer-vite-react`).\n- Updated Vite configurations for improved dev server integration.\n- Replaced Nginx with Caddy for enhanced flexibility and HMR support.\n\n* build(sdk): disable minification to preserve `@vite-ignore` in dynamic imports\n\n- Prevents Vite warnings in consuming projects caused by stripped `@vite-ignore` annotations during minification.\n- Consumers are responsible for minifying their own bundles.\n\n* refactor(sdk+shell): improve error logging and simplify code style\n\n- Wrapped `res.status` in `String` to ensure consistent type handling in error messages.\n- Replaced multiline statements and improved readability for `addedStyles` and `entryAbsPath` logic.\n- Standardized quotes in `Taskfile.yml` descriptions for consistency.\n- Updated `package-lock.json` to include `peer: true` for affected dependencies.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Jan Ackermann <jan.ackermann@real-digital.de>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqBym5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAwJUQAEwBFGEWeIO8aWZ/je9Acj6Z\n1gy4R4XEEfTKa8ungINwWWBxpjdytGAYhzw5KZSi5y4sAhDrEj1CKn8vWd/cyHDt\nAyG7Wd8bAtWAR9PzFsNE4goI58nph/QBgdZUDMs6Oy6J3olGEe9UMRserdhEn7n3\nVzKBYiKGIIk8iBxqqML8Ja4Lu7l5LcPa2DHuWcCp+L1NzKi+VrBjpVFy0vxRVMAY\nnLHy/b6VYDcdmP7NCVVF6Uyx+wRyTlymD/etVA1un26RMfKJFAE6wS59vzKwFeaK\nYOVepWbKtjnJreYvQD2lPuUfcNAuDRWaKIZesSLt+qUO/uFHrSg/m8+O7hwjwqf1\nQvAJeJGvzWLH3Y9/6HG5B5cMNficInFtmrV+rEeMwpr+feiTtkpPbfLf7hym/p3l\nHDQyu+Lxjm5SWUU3cYcKa0RTIZCsY+AR2x2pEz2zNy3jcVv4Kx/nvzpMqt28YuDS\n+c9DGAMwxyfWptVDmJegBEh6iXkmF57VzorPb8DrSk1IiL9S+a/vPQnjr1SYRpNG\nS1dQ5GxJQ7OYEISLZVGxhkI+VxiYS6meXP+7rnTOvA6+KE+yXoL6qslkbAT64XMb\nqLcQY2z0AQdNRhsyD7XFQUBYHuhN/nXh0aE/7CTF9mGq8sZgO+7+nnwjshdRJ9Ah\nL56mfLHMR/Kj7UjBzbDo\n=3VTL\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-15T14:12:09Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_