nalLifecycleFunctions` for custom element registration.\n- Refactored lifecycle management to handle external lifecycle functions.\n- Enhanced `createMfe` to align with changes, including async handling for `bootstrap`, `mount`, and `unmount`.\n- Improved error handling and logging for custom element operations.\n- Updated `mfe-react-one` and `mfe-vue-one` implementations to support new `register` method.\n- Added `data-auto-mount` attribute for automatic mounting of MFEs.\n- Adjusted `shell` to utilize the new `register` lifecycle step.","tree":{"sha":"f2025b417659dc83b5822a50d923c46304005225","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/F2WC/wcf-renderer/git/trees/f2025b417659dc83b5822a50d923c46304005225"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/F2WC/wcf-renderer/git/commits/f1736f63b6755a1aa6fec3cd4e0d7a5aa80e6a76","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/F2WC/wcf-renderer/commit/f1736f63b6755a1aa6fec3cd4e0d7a5aa80e6a76","node_id":"C_kwDOP3n-RdoAKGYxNzM2ZjYzYjY3NTVhMWFhNmZlYzNjZDRlMGQ3YTVhYTgwZTZhNzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/F2WC/wcf-renderer/commit/ec1a0dd4db482511f027473c6c5ae4588ce34929","sha":"ec1a0dd4db482511f027473c6c5ae4588ce34929","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/F2WC/wcf-renderer/commits/ec1a0dd4db482511f027473c6c5ae4588ce34929"}],"sha":"f1736f63b6755a1aa6fec3cd4e0d7a5aa80e6a76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/F2WC/wcf-renderer/commits/f1736f63b6755a1aa6fec3cd4e0d7a5aa80e6a76"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/F2WC/wcf-renderer/commits/ec1a0dd4db482511f027473c6c5ae4588ce34929/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-06T10:10:38Z","email":"jan.ackermann@real-digital.de","name":"Jan Ackermann"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-06T10:10:38Z","email":"jan.ackermann@real-digital.de","name":"Jan Ackermann"},"message":"fix(SDK): ensure unmount is called before deleting CSS styles","tree":{"sh