uthor":{"account":{"login":"danzeroum-cmd","providerType":"User"},"email":"danzeroum@gmail.com","name":"danzeroum"},"authoredDate":"2025-09-26T22:13:43Z","committedDate":"2025-09-26T22:13:43Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"danzeroum-cmd","providerType":"User"},"email":"danzeroum@gmail.com","name":"danzeroum"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T20:28:46.025Z","repositoryId":1064996826,"sha":"2e2306bba5935148fde619b9c2cbf8d51f5eb413"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T20:28:46.025Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1196518?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danzeroum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danzeroum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danzeroum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danzeroum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/danzeroum","id":1196518,"login":"danzeroum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExOTY1MTg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danzeroum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danzeroum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danzeroum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danzeroum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danzeroum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/danzeroum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danzeroum/BuildToValue_AI_Agent_Specialization/commits/9b4cb7539b4a48ce2e4a053a709c4a68af4b929d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T15:18:19Z","email":"danniellau@gmail.com","name":"DANIEL LAU PEREIRA SOARES"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T15:18:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: Add comprehensive Forge platform specification and roadmap (#10)\n\n* Adiciona plataforma Forge: plano unificado + scaffold Fase 1 (Rust + Python)\n\nPlano completo em docs/PLANO-PLATAFORMA-FORGE.md: CLI/TUI de coding agent\nque unifica as ideias do opencode (sessões duráveis, ModelTier, verificação\ndeterminística), do prompte (geradores, quality linter, cache por hash,\ngateway com fallback) e do BuildToValue (squad multi-agente, consenso\nponderado, HITL, ledger, review por valor), com núcleo Rust + sidecar\nPython integrados por gRPC/UDS.\n\nScaffold executável em platform/:\n- cargo workspace com 10 crates; uv workspace com 5 pacotes Python\n- contratos: 3 protos gRPC, 6 JSON Schemas versionados e fixtures de\n  paridade do hash de cache validadas em Rust e Python\n- ModelTier portado, motor de permissões (build/plan/general), ledger\n  append-only com hash-chain, pipeline /verify mínimo, consenso ponderado\n  migrado (pydantic), primeiros geradores e linter de prompts\n- justfile, CI (cargo/pytest/gitleaks), ADR 0001\n- 26 testes Rust + 13 Python verdes; clippy e rustfmt limpos\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018e6pffjwaBfFaHvizrbnXa\n\n* Adiciona roadmap visual interativo da plataforma Forge\n\nVersão autocontida (React, ReactDOM e runtime DC embutidos) do roadmap\nem docs/roadmap-forge.html: regra de fronteira Rust/Python com a ponte\ngRPC/UDS, árvore do workspace platform/, timeline expansível das 6 fases,\nmatriz de cobertura filtrável por origem e fase, contratos/reuso/\nverificação em acordeões e grade de riscos. Fontes externas têm fallback\nde sistema; nenhuma outra dependência de rede.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018e6pffjwaBfFaHvizrbnXa\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b9bb040017c5366ee7b580e0af04b0e446f190cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danzeroum/BuildToValue_AI_Agent_Specialization/git/trees/b9bb040017c5366ee7b580e0af04b0e446f190cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danzeroum/BuildToValue_AI_Agent_Specialization/git